  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.8.2:\n      - Adds mapper and projection analyzer warnings for undeclared mapping rules, reverse sensitive writes, raw public IDs, mapper calls inside query expressions, custom projection methods, and complex projection captures.\n      - Keeps analyzer rules source-only, generator-free, code-fix-free, and conservative about provider translation limits.\n      - Expands analyzer docs, tests, and release verification for the 1.8.x analyzer lane.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
